條。上甚悅，寶愛之。遺詔以經本入玄宮。宋末卒。","reading":"關康之字伯愉，與榮緒號二隱；徵辟、治經、宋末卒合成附傳。","note":"關康之字伯愉，與榮緒號二隱；徵辟、治經、宋末卒合成附傳。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":178,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi054-guankangzhi-death","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","start":176,"end":177,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":"宋末","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-054","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete-ws1762878","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","quote":"　　初，榮緒與關康之俱隱在京口，世號爲「二隱」。康之字伯愉，河東人。世居丹徒。以墳籍爲務。四十年不出門。不應州府辟。宋太始中，徵通直郎，不就。晚以母老家貧，求爲嶺南小縣。性清約，獨處一室，稀與妻子相見。不通賔客。弟子以業傳受。尤善《左氏春秋》。太祖爲領軍，素好此學，送《春秋五經》，康之手自點定，幷得論禮記十餘條。上甚悅，寶愛之。遺詔以經本入玄宮。宋末卒。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042:m0007"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p040:m0140","start":140,"end":143,"surface":"關康之","kind":"person","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p040","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042:m0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"關康之","kind":"person","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042:m0024","start":24,"end":26,"surface":"康之","kind":"person","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042:m0027","start":27,"end":29,"surface":"伯愉","kind":"person","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042:m0141","start":141,"end":143,"surface":"康之","kind":"person","person_id":"2ds_6kw_g53","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p042","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete"}],"relations":[],"title_holdings":[],"address_assertions":[],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-054-recluses-complete:p040","text":"　　純篤好學，括東西晉爲一書，紀、錄、志、傳百一十卷。隱居京口教授。南徐州辟西曹，舉秀才，不就。太祖爲揚州，徵榮緒爲主簿，不到。司徒褚淵少時嘗命駕尋之。建元中，啟太祖曰：「榮緒，朱方隱者。昔臧質在宋，以國戚出牧彭岱，引爲行佐，非其所好，謝疾求免。蓬廬守志，漏濕是安，灌蔬終老。與友關康之沈深典素，追古著書，撰《晉史》十袠，贊論雖無逸才，亦足彌綸一代。臣歲時往京口，早與之遇。近報其取書，始方送出，庶得備錄渠閣，採異甄善。」上答曰：「公所道臧榮緒者，吾甚志之。其有史翰，欲令入天祿，甚佳。」","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":106,"last_line":106,"raw_start":5842,"raw_end":6086,"raw_character_offsets":[5842,5843,5844,5845,5846,5847,5848,5849,5850,5851,5852,5853,5854,5855,5856,5857,5858,5859,5860,5861,5862,5863,5864,5865,5866,5867,5868,5869,5870,5871,5872,5873,5874,5875,5876,5877,5878,5879,5880,5881,5882,5883,5884,5885,5886,5887,5888,5889,5890,5891,5892,5893,5894,5895,5896,5897,5898,5899,5900,5901,5902,5903,5904,5905,5906,5907,5908,5909,5910,5911,5912,5913,5914,5915,5916,5917,5918,5919,5920,5921,5922,5923,5924,5925,5926,5927,5928,5929,5930,5931,5932,5933,5934,5935,5936,5937,5938,5939,5940,5941,